   "widgets_values": [
    "# Kindred Brand \u2014 product\n\n**FLUX-dev brand background** \u2014 1080\u00d71080.\n\n**Makes:** PROMPT_PLACEHOLDER, Kindred Systems AI brand identity, premium product campaign direction, industrial dark environment with controlled electric teal a...\n\n**No text/logo baked in** \u2014 these are clean backgrounds; text and the hex icons go on in Canva so the design team self-serves.\n\n**Settings:** FLUX-dev, guidance ~3.2-3.5. Swap the prompt / change EmptyLatentImage size for a new format. Reroll the seed (RandomNoise) if FLUX sneaks faint fake text onto a chip.\n\n---\n\ud83d\udcda [Tutorial](https://docs.comfy.org/tutorials/flux/flux-1-text-to-image) \u00b7 Docs: https://docs.comfy.org/"
